0 BEGIN PGM CYCLES MM
1 ; WRITTEN FOR GEDIT - SYNTHETIC TEST PROGRAM, NOT FOR A MACHINE
2 TOOL CALL 1 Z S3000
3 L Z+100 R0 FMAX M3
4 L X+10 Y+10 R0 FMAX M99
5 CYCL DEF 999 A CYCLE THE DATABASE DOES NOT KNOW ~
  Q200=2 ;CLEARANCE
6 L X+20 Y+20 R0 FMAX M99
7 CYCL DEF 200 DRILLING ~
  Q200=2 ;CLEARANCE ~
  Q201=-10 ;DEPTH ~
  Q206=150 ;PLUNGE FEED ~
  Q202=5 ;PECK ~
  Q210=0 ;DWELL AT TOP ~
  Q203=+0 ;SURFACE ~
  Q204=50 ;2ND CLEARANCE ~
  Q211=0 ;DWELL AT DEPTH
8 L X+30 Y+30 R0 FMAX M99
9 CYCL CALL
10 M30
11 END PGM CYCLES MM
